  "subtitle": "",
  "level": [
   "Bachelor",
   "Master"
  ],
  "levelText": "Master and Bachelor",
  "supervisors": [
   {
    "name": "Morten S. Jellesen",
    "email": "msje@dtu.dk",
    "role": "",
    "affiliation": ""
   },
   {
    "name": "John Hald",
    "email": "jhald@dtu.dk",
    "role": "",
    "affiliation": ""
   },
   {
    "name": "Birgitte Stoffersen",
    "email": "birst@dtu.dk",
    "role": "",
    "affiliation": ""
   }
  ],
  "collaboration": [
   "Molten Salt companies as Copenhagen Atomics, Seaborg Technologies or Nordic Salt Cycle"
  ],
  "sections": [
   {
    "key": "background",
    "title": "Background",
    "note": "",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The focus of this project is an investigation of the short-range ordering (SRO) and long-range ordering (LRO) that can occur in Ni-Cr-Fe alloys. Industry applications such as next-generation salt-moderated nuclear power plants and salt thermal energy storage systems are highly corrosive environments relying on Ni-Cr-Fe alloys for tubes and tanks."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "key": "aim",
    "title": "Aim",
    "note": "",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "SRO and LRO are phenomena that can occur in Ni-Cr alloys where the nickel and chromium atoms arrange in a non-stoichiometric Ni2Cr phase. This type of ordering is known to occur after long-time exposure to temperatures between 350-550°C. The ordering can lead to severely decreased mechanical properties by negative creep and promoted planar slip resulting in catastrophic failure of the affected part."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "key": "activities",
    "title": "What you will work on",
    "note": "",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The project is experimental but will also require the student to apply knowledge from literature to find a viable solution to the challenges. The experimental part could include:"
     },
     {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Heat treatment of relevant Ni-Cr tubes and coupons using furnaces.",
      "lvl": 0,
      "sub": []
     },
     {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Evaluation of the developed ordering and the severity of the ordering.",
      "lvl": 0,
      "sub": []
     },
     {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Characterization of the heat-treated alloys using: LOM, XRD, SEM, EDS, TEM and micro-hardness",
      "lvl": 0,
      "sub": []
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "key": "notes",
    "title": "Practical notes",
    "note": "",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The exact topic and nature of the project will be specified in a discussion with the students who are interested."
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
